This distribution bundles agent-skill content (skills/astra-toolkit/) vendored
from https://github.com/sl-at-ibm/astra-toolkit-skill (Stefano Lottini, IBM /
DataStax) at commit aebf0d6e2a297bf7c2a049f238acf82832303b8f (2026-08-21),
which itself derives its instruction files and code examples from the DataStax
documentation (https://docs.datastax.com). The same examples ship inside the
@erichare/astra-mcp npm package and the .mcpb bundle for the code_examples tool.

Modifications made in this repository since vendoring:
- examples read credentials from ASTRA_DB_APPLICATION_TOKEN /
  ASTRA_DB_API_ENDPOINT environment variables instead of placeholders
  (scripts/codemod-examples.mjs), with the matching imports added;
- one Go example gained a missing composite-literal comma;
- per-language INDEX.md files (scripts/build-examples-index.mjs);
- SKILL.md description and Credentials / Live database tools sections,
  consistent env var names in astra-cli/ and architecture/ READMEs.

